  "behavioral_change": "requests v_old 2.31.0 to v_new 2.32.2. HTTPAdapter.send now obtains connections through the new hook HTTPAdapter.get_connection_with_tls_context, so a subclass override of HTTPAdapter.get_connection is no longer called back.",
